<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About — KisaanMitra</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ============ NAVBAR ============ -->
  <%- include ("includes/navbar") %>

   <section class="about-hero">

        <div class="hero-content">

            <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT KISAANMITRA AI</span>

            <h1>
                Technology with a
                <span>Purpose.</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                KisaanMitra AI is a farmer-focused intelligent platform
                designed to bring agricultural information, AI assistance,
                and smart farming tools together in one place.
            </p>

            <a href="/chat" class="primary-btn">
                Talk to KisaanMitra
                <span>→</span>
            </a>

        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual">

            <div class="farm-glow"></div>

            <div class="ai-orbit orbit-one"></div>
            <div class="ai-orbit orbit-two"></div>

            <div class="ai-core">
                <div class="core-icon">✦</div>
                <span>AI</span>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= WHY ================= -->

    <section class="problem-section">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <span class="eyebrow">WHY KISAANMITRA?</span>

            <h2>
                Farming decisions shouldn't
                <span>be a guessing game.</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                Farmers make important decisions every day, but the
                information needed to make those decisions is often
                scattered across different sources.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="problem-grid">

            <div class="problem-card">
                <span class="card-number">01</span>
                <div class="problem-icon">🌦</div>
                <h3>Weather</h3>
                <p>
                    Understand weather conditions that can influence
                    farming decisions.
                </p>
            </div>


            <div class="problem-card">
                <span class="card-number">02</span>
                <div class="problem-icon">🌱</div>
                <h3>Crop</h3>
                <p>
                    Get useful information for better crop planning
                    and management.
                </p>
            </div>


            <div class="problem-card">
                <span class="card-number">03</span>
                <div class="problem-icon">🦠</div>
                <h3>Disease</h3>
                <p>
                    Identify possible crop problems and understand
                    the next steps.
                </p>
            </div>


            <div class="problem-card">
                <span class="card-number">04</span>
                <div class="problem-icon">📈</div>
                <h3>Market</h3>
                <p>
                    Access market-related information for smarter
                    selling decisions.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= INTELLIGENCE ================= -->

    <section class="intelligence-section">

        <div class="intelligence-text">

            <span class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</span>

            <h2>
                One intelligence layer.
                <span>Multiple farming decisions.</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                Instead of treating every agricultural problem separately,
                KisaanMitra brings different farming needs into one
                connected experience.
            </p>

            <p>
                The goal is simple — give farmers useful information
                without making them search through multiple platforms.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="intelligence-map">

            <div class="connection connection-1"></div>
            <div class="connection connection-2"></div>
            <div class="connection connection-3"></div>
            <div class="connection connection-4"></div>
            <div class="connection connection-5"></div>

            <div class="central-ai">
                <span>✦</span>
                <strong>KisaanMitra</strong>
                <small>AI Intelligence</small>
            </div>

            <div class="int-node node-weather">
                🌦
                <small>Weather</small>
            </div>

            <div class="int-node node-crop">
                🌱
                <small>Crop</small>
            </div>

            <div class="int-node node-disease">
                🦠
                <small>Disease</small>
            </div>

            <div class="int-node node-market">
                📊
                <small>Market</small>
            </div>

            <div class="int-node node-scheme">
                🏛
                <small>Schemes</small>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= -->

    <section class="workflow-section">

        <div class="section-heading center">

            <span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span>

            <h2>
                From a question to an
                <span>actionable answer.</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="workflow">

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <span>01</span>
                <h3>Ask</h3>
                <p>
                    The farmer describes a problem or asks a question.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-line"></div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <span>02</span>
                <h3>Understand</h3>
                <p>
                    KisaanMitra processes the farmer's request.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-line"></div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <span>03</span>
                <h3>Analyze</h3>
                <p>
                    Relevant agricultural information is considered.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-line"></div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <span>04</span>
                <h3>Guide</h3>
                <p>
                    The farmer receives clear and practical guidance.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= TECHNOLOGY ================= -->

    <section class="technology-section">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <span class="eyebrow">THE TECHNOLOGY</span>

            <h2>
                Built with modern technology.
                <span>Designed for a real problem.</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="tech-grid">

            <div class="tech-card">
                <span class="tech-label">01</span>
                <h3>Frontend</h3>

                <div class="tech-tags">
                    <span>HTML</span>
                    <span>CSS</span>
                    <span>JavaScript</span>
                    <span>EJS</span>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="tech-card">
                <span class="tech-label">02</span>
                <h3>Backend</h3>

                <div class="tech-tags">
                    <span>Node.js</span>
                    <span>Express.js</span>
                    <span>REST APIs</span>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="tech-card">
                <span class="tech-label">03</span>
                <h3>Database</h3>

                <div class="tech-tags">
                    <span>MongoDB</span>
                    <span>Mongoose</span>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="tech-card">
                <span class="tech-label">04</span>
                <h3>AI & Services</h3>

                <div class="tech-tags">
                    <span>Gemini</span>
                    <span>Cloudinary</span>
                    <span>APIs</span>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= ARCHITECTURE ================= -->

    <section class="architecture-section">

        <div class="section-heading center">

            <span class="eyebrow">SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE</span>

            <h2>
                How the platform
                <span>comes together.</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="architecture">

            <div class="arch-box">
                <strong>FARMER</strong>
                <small>Input / Interaction</small>
            </div>

            <div class="arch-arrow">↓</div>

            <div class="arch-box">
                <strong>KISAANMITRA UI</strong>
                <small>EJS • HTML • CSS • JS</small>
            </div>

            <div class="arch-arrow">↓</div>

            <div class="arch-box">
                <strong>APPLICATION SERVER</strong>
                <small>Node.js • Express.js</small>
            </div>

            <div class="arch-arrow">↓</div>

            <div class="arch-row">

                <div class="arch-box small-box">
                    <strong>AI</strong>
                    <small>Intelligence</small>
                </div>

                <div class="arch-box small-box">
                    <strong>DATABASE</strong>
                    <small>MongoDB</small>
                </div>

                <div class="arch-box small-box">
                    <strong>APIs</strong>
                    <small>External Data</small>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="arch-arrow">↓</div>

            <div class="arch-box response-box">
                <strong>ACTIONABLE GUIDANCE</strong>
                <small>Clear • Useful • Farmer-focused</small>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= CREATOR ================= -->

    <section class="creator-section">

        <div class="creator-image">
            <!-- तुझा फोटो इथे ठेव -->
            <img src="/images/NEWprofile-khushal.png" alt="Khushal Paunkar">
        </div>


        <div class="creator-content">

            <span class="creator-heading"> MEET THE DEVELOPER </span>

            <h2>
                Built with code.
                <span>Inspired by a real problem.</span>
            </h2>

            <p class="creator-intro">
                Hi, I'm <strong>Khushal Paunkar</strong>, a Computer Science
                & Engineering student and the creator of KisaanMitra AI.
            </p>

            <p>
                I built KisaanMitra as a major project to explore how
                modern web technologies and artificial intelligence can
                be combined to solve meaningful real-world problems.
            </p>

            <p>
                This project brings together my interests in full-stack
                development, backend engineering, databases and AI into
                one practical platform for agriculture.
            </p>


        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= MY ROLE ================= -->

    <section class="role-section">

        <div class="section-heading center">

            <span class="eyebrow">MY ROLE</span>

            <h2>
                From an idea to a
                <span>working platform.</span>
            </h2>

        </div>


        <div class="role-grid">

            <div class="role-item">
                <span>01</span>
                <h3>Concept</h3>
                <p>Defined the problem and product direction.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="role-item">
                <span>02</span>
                <h3>UI / UX</h3>
                <p>Designed the farmer-focused user experience.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="role-item">
                <span>03</span>
                <h3>Development</h3>
                <p>Built the frontend and backend architecture.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="role-item">
                <span>04</span>
                <h3>Integration</h3>
                <p>Connected AI, database and application services.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="role-item">
                <span>05</span>
                <h3>Testing</h3>
                <p>Tested features and improved the user experience.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ================= VISION ================= -->

    <section class="vision-section">

        <span class="eyebrow">OUR VISION</span>

        <h2>
            A future where every farmer
            has access to <span>better information.</span>
        </h2>

        <p>
            KisaanMitra is just the beginning. The long-term vision is to
            make agricultural technology more accessible, understandable,
            and useful for farmers.
        </p>

        <a href="/chat" class="primary-btn">
            Start with KisaanMitra
            <span>→</span>
        </a>

    </section>



    
  <!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
  <%- include ("includes/footer") %>

</body>
</html>